          "messageID": "msg_ses_44_08",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Passing sometimes is exactly what a flaky test does — it doesn't mean the underlying issue is gone, it means you got lucky on timing this time. If it's truly a DB-readiness race, it'll come back and fail again for someone else, probably in CI where timing is different. Let's add a proper wait for the DB connection in the test setup before merging, rather than relying on reruns."
